  "releaseNotes": "v5.8.31 - on SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.4.49. Browser: models load whole from hosts that compress responses (GitHub Pages gzips .onnx and .tflite: the model was cut off at the compressed Content-Length); cross-origin model loads need no CORS preflight; a host that hides Content-Range no longer makes the model cache store a file cut at 512 KB as complete; ranged requests bypass the HTTP cache, which Chrome answered wrongly after a compressed fetch of the same URL; size probes are never the compressed size. No API change.",
